Package: riscos-harddisc
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: riscos-support (>= 1.0.0044-1)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-rolpkg
Description: RISC OS on Linux's own parts of HardDisc4
 The RISC OS side of RISC OS on Linux, in HardDisc4: the Updates and
 Linux network Configure plug-ins, the hard disc icon (DiscIcon), RiSH
 (the RISC Shell: the Linux terminal, in Apps), and the LinuxShell (*Linux) and USBDriver
 modules. Your own files and choices are never touched.
